      {
        "id": 202074,
        "name": "speedyolrac",
        "username": "speedyolrac",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-24T20:15:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"RySmith6\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rysmith6/48/1852_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> RySmith6:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As to the FLGS thing, I know Paul and Craig were encouraging multiple people over the course of the con to tell their FLGS to order it, so they seemed very in favor of people going that route!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>That is what I heard, So I went with that, even if it takes a bit longer. I am happy to gush over the game with them, might even offer to run a demo.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>But until then I will sit here in excitement. Going to look over all the images I can find on it till then.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
