        "created_at": "2017-08-25T18:46:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>@Phantom: It kinda sounds like your group would be happier just meeting over IRC.</p><p>I think electronic tools are awesome but when they start replacing the non-electronic <em>experiences</em> of a thing it can be an issue.</p>",
