      {
        "id": 202077,
        "name": "Phantom5613",
        "username": "Phantom5613",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-25T19:09:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"mention\">@Phantom</span>: It kinda sounds like your group would be happier just meeting over IRC.I think electronic tools are awesome but when they start replacing the non-electronic <em>experiences</em> of a thing it can be an issue.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I agree, but when it's a group you've been playing with for a while that started out as pen and paper, you try your best to not have things go down the digital toilet. I do have other groups that I play with, it's just that this is the one I've been playing with the longest.</p>",
